   "detailed_description": "Q. 這是一款怎樣的遊戲呢？<br><br>A. 在帕魯的世界，你可以選擇與神奇的生物「帕魯」一同享受悠閑的生活，也可以投身於與偷獵者進行生死搏鬥的冒險。<br><br>玩家能夠派出帕魯們戰鬥、交配繁衍、幫忙務農，或是讓牠們在工廠裡幫忙。<br>或是看情況把牠們賣掉，甚至是肢解作為食材也可以。<br><br><br><strong><u>生存</u></strong><br>糧食不足、嚴酷的環境……以及違法盜獵者。這個世界四處充滿著危險。為了存活下去只能不擇手段。就算是得將帕魯們作為食物……<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1623730/extras/2b2402730f698b3c10c82c054cd4c47d.poster.avif?t=1790336367\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1623730/extras/2b2402730f698b3c10c82c054cd4c47d.webm?t=1790336367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1623730/extras/2b2402730f698b3c10c82c054cd4c47d.mp4?t=1790336367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><u>騎乘、探索</u></strong><br>乘坐上帕魯就能在陸、海、空的各種地帶盡情遨遊跟探索。<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1623730/extras/f2524dd877a8705d3bd6ae8a68a206f3.poster.avif?t=1790336367\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1623730/extras/f2524dd877a8705d3bd6ae8a68a206f3.webm?t=1790336367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1623730/extras/f2524dd877a8705d3bd6ae8a68a206f3.mp4?t=1790336367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><u>建築</u></strong><br>想要蓋一座雄偉的金字塔嗎？那就呼喊大量的帕魯來當苦力吧。帕魯們不適用於勞基法，不用怕會有人告上門來。<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1623730/extras/5b945d8350fe14110dd3f542df0eced1.poster.avif?t=1790336367\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1623730/extras/5b945d8350fe14110dd3f542df0eced1.webm?t=1790336367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1623730/extras/5b945d8350fe14110dd3f542df0eced1.mp4?t=1790336367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><u>生活</u></strong><br>生火、發電、采掘……。收集各種不同類型的便利帕魯，來享受舒適的生活吧。<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1623730/extras/a8ab4ca622ac6c491541fae9ea3b672f.poster.avif?t=1790336367\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1623730/extras/a8ab4ca622ac6c491541fae9ea3b672f.webm?t=1790336367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1623730/extras/a8ab4ca622ac6c491541fae9ea3b672f.mp4?t=1790336367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><u>農業</u></strong><br>帕魯們各有牠們擅長的工作，像是播種、澆水、收成作物等等。和帕魯們一起打造出魅力十足的農園吧。<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1623730/extras/ba80ddf24602c2de6aae326e95d6d228.poster.avif?t=1790336367\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1623730/extras/ba80ddf24602c2de6aae326e95d6d228.webm?t=1790336367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1623730/extras/ba80ddf24602c2de6aae326e95d6d228.mp4?t=1790336367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><u>自動化工業</u></strong><br>為了實現自動化，將手工作業交給帕魯就尤為重要。建造工廠，並安排帕魯在其中工作吧。只要有足夠的食物，帕魯就可以不斷地工作，直到牠們生命的盡頭。<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1623730/extras/2ae72a791bb84ca97e46e9227e6ac4d7.poster.avif?t=1790336367\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1623730/extras/2ae72a791bb84ca97e46e9227e6ac4d7.webm?t=1790336367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1623730/extras/2ae72a791bb84ca97e46e9227e6ac4d7.mp4?t=1790336367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><u>探索地下城</u></strong><br>有帕魯在，哪怕危險的區域也大可放心。在危機時刻，你可以讓帕魯做你的替身。牠們會不惜一切，哪怕舍棄自己的生命也會保護你。<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1623730/extras/752721ee7db99e1eb6cb7d588d464769.poster.avif?t=1790336367\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1623730/extras/752721ee7db99e1eb6cb7d588d464769.webm?t=1790336367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1623730/extras/752721ee7db99e1eb6cb7d588d464769.mp4?t=1790336367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><u>繁殖、遺傳</u></strong><br>讓帕魯們繁殖，下一代就會繼承到雙親的特徵。透過組合稀有的帕魯們來繁育出最強大的帕魯吧！<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1623730/extras/6abae7ea3d546cf9e98359f801f4784f.poster.avif?t=1790336367\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1623730/extras/6abae7ea3d546cf9e98359f801f4784f.webm?t=1790336367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1623730/extras/6abae7ea3d546cf9e98359f801f4784f.mp4?t=1790336367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><u>盜獵、犯罪</u></strong><br>在禁獵區棲息著瀕臨滅絕的稀有帕魯。只要偷偷潛入捕抓起來就能一夜致富！別怕，沒被發現就不算是犯罪。<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1623730/extras/2030b4c9bba0cd0a8258452c410e0483.poster.avif?t=1790336367\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1623730/extras/2030b4c9bba0cd0a8258452c410e0483.webm?t=1790336367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1623730/extras/2030b4c9bba0cd0a8258452c410e0483.mp4?t=1790336367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><u>多人同樂</u></strong><br>本作品支持多人同樂。快邀請親朋好友們一起來冒險吧。當然也能夠進行對戰和交易哦。<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1623730/extras/cb75478a82fdce7adc094a8ae8d4d541.poster.avif?t=1790336367\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1623730/extras/cb75478a82fdce7adc094a8ae8d4d541.webm?t=1790336367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1623730/extras/cb75478a82fdce7adc094a8ae8d4d541.mp4?t=1790336367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
